energy can be converted to matter and

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:47.680
matter to energy that you can get all of

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:50.959
the stuff that we see in the universe

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:53.600
from this pure energetic event.

00:12:50.959 --> 00:12:56.600
Einstein's little equation had a big

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:56.600
impact.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:09.240
It led to the first nuclear bombs.

